@startuml
[*] --> RequestReceived : receipt of video suggestion request
RequestReceived : entry / nil
RequestReceived : do / identify user / UserIdentified
RequestReceived : exit / valid identification / UserIdentified

UserIdentified : entry / nil
UserIdentified : do / gather videos / VideosGathered
UserIdentified : exit / valid gathering / VideosGathered

VideosGathered --> DetailsAdded : completion of gathering different types of videos
DetailsAdded : entry / nil
DetailsAdded : do / add additional details / SuggestedVideosSent
DetailsAdded : exit / valid addition / SuggestedVideosSent

SuggestedVideosSent --> [*] : sending suggested videos to the user
@enduml
